    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d806-a4">

                <pb facs="0838" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg788"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 4, in No. 145.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bartleman to Mr.
                            Henderson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_apparent-typo-based-on-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of 2d just received. I see no reason why agent should refuse to
                    give bond pending court’s decision, as he claims there has been no violation of
                    the law.</p>
                <p>Will wire to-morrow if permission is obtained for clearance by Macareo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. M. Bartleman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
